{"unit_id":"heswy__dsh-plugin-codex-bridge#card-zh","repo":"heswy/dsh-plugin-codex-bridge","commit":"07ae5a3903b4c03a142e9220aa04f180691dbeb3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-codex-bridge（DSH 插件，网页桌面客户端）：把其他 DSH 进程登记的工作区同步到当前桌面侧栏，并提供由持有会话的宿主代为投递消息的协作通道。插件通过周期性对账补充缺失工作区，侧栏按钮可手动刷新；文件投递箱支持向指定会话排队发送任务并生成回执，也会发布会话索引供发送端选择目标。适合用 Codex 规划和审查、由 DSH 会话实施并接收后续修复意见的开发流程。插件不需 API 密钥，默认配置使用本机 DSH 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:353-360","lib/client.js:94-129","lib/inbox.js:191-240"]}
{"unit_id":"heswy__dsh-plugin-codex-bridge#card-en","repo":"heswy/dsh-plugin-codex-bridge","commit":"07ae5a3903b4c03a142e9220aa04f180691dbeb3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-codex-bridge syncs workspaces from other DSH processes into the desktop sidebar. Users can refresh manually, queue messages for a session, and read receipts. A session index helps senders choose a target. It supports Codex and DSH development workflows without an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:353-360","lib/client.js:94-129","lib/inbox.js:191-240"]}
